{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Dragon Shelter",
    "steam_appid": 2712590,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a thrilling adventure where friendship, love, care, and hard work help you bring back harmony. Restore the lost connection between humans and dragons and transform the abandoned world into a place full of happiness and kindness. Grow crops, gather valuable resources, take care of adorable dragons, and help the townsfolk rediscover their long-forgotten joy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712590/extras/7061606654d1130197e84196b6b3f4c6.avif?t=1749480600\" data-has-big width=800 height=255 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the friendly, playful, and kind-hearted dragons, each with its own special traits. These dragons can sense people's needs and use their unique powers. If you take good care of them, these amazing creatures will become your loyal friends and helpful buddies on the farm. Make your dragons happy by giving them love and playtime!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712590/extras/6d93e58fa036fda3b851148c83260895.avif?t=1749480600\" data-has-big width=800 height=249 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your dragon helpers will aid you in transforming your grandfather's old farm into a haven of safety and support. Turn this abandoned place into an oasis where joy and friendship flourish. Cultivate crops, harvest resources, produce valuable goods, and help the town and nature recover. Watch as the land is revitalized and the world brightens up thanks to your nurturing care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712590/extras/7f9eecbf2d2b19f5ab3c6ea57983d73c.avif?t=1749480600\" data-has-big width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The farm isn't too far from the darkened city. The folks there are gloomy and grumpy, having lost faith in joy and friendship. Deep down, though, they yearn for happiness. With your assistance, they'll start to change, showing a completely different side of themselves. Together with the dragons, help the townsfolk rekindle warm memories and revive their zest for life as you discover each resident's touching stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712590/extras/2f1ac56e9adca37f5b9d8a078b2fcf5e.avif?t=1749480600\" data-has-big width=800 height=249 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Dragon Shelter is bursting with vibrant colors and extraordinary creatures. Every nook and cranny of the adventure holds the promise of incredible discoveries and joy. Set out on your exploration, and who knows, you might stumble upon something exceptionally amusing along the way!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a thrilling adventure where friendship, love, care, and hard work help you bring back harmony. Restore the lost connection between humans and dragons and transform the abandoned world into a place full of happiness and kindness. Grow crops, gather valuable resources, take care of adorable dragons, and help the townsfolk rediscover their long-forgotten joy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712590/extras/7061606654d1130197e84196b6b3f4c6.avif?t=1749480600\" data-has-big width=800 height=255 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the friendly, playful, and kind-hearted dragons, each with its own special traits. These dragons can sense people's needs and use their unique powers. If you take good care of them, these amazing creatures will become your loyal friends and helpful buddies on the farm. Make your dragons happy by giving them love and playtime!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712590/extras/6d93e58fa036fda3b851148c83260895.avif?t=1749480600\" data-has-big width=800 height=249 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your dragon helpers will aid you in transforming your grandfather's old farm into a haven of safety and support. Turn this abandoned place into an oasis where joy and friendship flourish. Cultivate crops, harvest resources, produce valuable goods, and help the town and nature recover. Watch as the land is revitalized and the world brightens up thanks to your nurturing care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712590/extras/7f9eecbf2d2b19f5ab3c6ea57983d73c.avif?t=1749480600\" data-has-big width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The farm isn't too far from the darkened city. The folks there are gloomy and grumpy, having lost faith in joy and friendship. Deep down, though, they yearn for happiness. With your assistance, they'll start to change, showing a completely different side of themselves. Together with the dragons, help the townsfolk rekindle warm memories and revive their zest for life as you discover each resident's touching stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712590/extras/2f1ac56e9adca37f5b9d8a078b2fcf5e.avif?t=1749480600\" data-has-big width=800 height=249 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Dragon Shelter is bursting with vibrant colors and extraordinary creatures. Every nook and cranny of the adventure holds the promise of incredible discoveries and joy. Set out on your exploration, and who knows, you might stumble upon something exceptionally amusing along the way!</p>",
    "short_description": "Dragon Shelter is a farming sim set in a fantasy world. Become a hero who'll reignite the long-lost friendship between humans and dragons. Care for wondrous creatures, explore the magical world, and cook enchanted dishes together!",
